  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "There is **no official \"Rust 2026 Edition.\"** Depending on whether you are referring to the programming language or the video game, here is the relevant context:\n\n---\n\n### 1. The Rust Programming Language\n"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "The Rust language releases **editions** on a three-year cadence to introduce opt-in language changes that might otherwise break backwards compatibility",
   "citations": [
    {
     "cited_text": "The Rust language releases **editions** on a three-year cadence to introduce opt-in language changes that might otherwise break backwards compatibility",
     "title": "endoflife.date",
     "type": "web_search_result_location",
     "url": "https://endoflife.date/rust"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": ":\n* "
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Rust 2015:** Released alongside Rust 1.0 (May 2015)",
   "citations": [
    {
     "cited_text": "**Rust 2015:** Released alongside Rust 1.0 (May 2015)",
     "title": "endoflife.date",
     "type": "web_search_result_location",
     "url": "https://endoflife.date/rust"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": ".\n* "
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Rust 2018:** Released alongside Rust 1.31 (December 2018)",
   "citations": [
    {
     "cited_text": "**Rust 2018:** Released alongside Rust 1.31 (December 2018)",
     "title": "endoflife.date",
     "type": "web_search_result_location",
     "url": "https://endoflife.date/rust"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": ".\n* "
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Rust 2021:** Released alongside Rust 1.56 (October 2021)",
   "citations": [
    {
     "cited_text": "**Rust 2021:** Released alongside Rust 1.56 (October 2021)",
     "title": "endoflife.date",
     "type": "web_search_result_location",
     "url": "https://endoflife.date/rust"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": ".\n* "
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Rust 2024:** Released alongside Rust 1.85 (February 2025)",
   "citations": [
    {
     "cited_text": "**Rust 2024:** Released alongside Rust 1.85 (February 2025)",
     "title": "endoflife.date",
     "type": "web_search_result_location",
     "url": "https://endoflife.date/rust"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": ".\n\n"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Because of this three-year cycle, the edition following Rust 2024 will be **Rust 2027**, which is anticipated around late 2027 or early 2028",
   "citations": [
    {
     "cited_text": "Because of this three-year cycle, the edition following Rust 2024 will be **Rust 2027**, which is anticipated around late 2027 or early 2028",
     "title": "rust-lang.org",
     "type": "web_search_result_location",
     "url": "https://internals.rust-lang.org/t/we-have-only-two-years-to-prepare-the-rust-2027-edition/22494"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": ". \n\n---\n\n### 2. *Rust* (Video Game by Facepunch Studios)\n"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "The survival game *Rust* does not release numbered yearly editions",
   "citations": [
    {
     "cited_text": "The survival game *Rust* does not release numbered yearly editions",
     "title": "physgun.com",
     "type": "web_search_result_location",
     "url": "https://physgun.com/blog/game-hosting/rust/rust-2026-roadmap-upcoming-features/"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": ". Instead, it follows a continuous development model:\n* "
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Monthly Forced Wipes/Updates:** Arrive regularly on the **first Thursday of every month**",
   "citations": [
    {
     "cited_text": "**Monthly Forced Wipes/Updates:** Arrive regularly on the **first Thursday of every month**",
     "title": "bisecthosting.com",
     "type": "web_search_result_location",
     "url": "https://www.bisecthosting.com/blog/rust-september-2026-wipe-update-release-date-patch-notes-hqm-node-honey-bandage-tc-upkeep"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
